  (descr "Compatible with Cherry MX Low Profile, Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and Choc V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile), User.3=13.95mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 1.25u vertical (1u wide x 1.25u tall, courtyard 19.00x23.76mm).")
